  <!-- ====== HERO ====== -->
  <section class="hero"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-badge">
      
      <span class="pill"><span class="dot"></span>NIRVAN '26 · TECHNICAL FEST</span>
    </div>
    <h1><span>WEB-A-THON</span><span class="grad">4.0</span></h1>
    <p class="ver">DESIGN • DEVELOP • DEPLOY</p>
    <p class="lead">The flagship Web Design &amp; Development challenge of NIRVAN '26, presented by the <b>Tech Geeks Club</b>, School of Engineering &amp; Computer Applications — <b>Graphic Era Hill University, Haldwani Campus</b>. Build a live, responsive product in 24 hours and let your UI/UX creativity speak.</p>
