        <div class="ev"><span>DAY 02 · 04:00 PM</span><h4>Valedictory &amp; Prize Distribution</h4><p>Winners announced, certificates for every participant.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="shot" style="height:330px"><img src="hiee.jpeg" alt="Fest stage"><span class="cap">// NIRVAN FEST · MAIN AUDITORIUM</span></div>
      <div class="card" style="margin-top:22px">
